    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "Authenticated REST API for Aevo exchange providing account management, order placement and management, position tracking, portfolio data, transfers, withdrawals, and trading history. Requires AEVO-KEY and AEVO-SECRET authentication headers obtained via cryptographic key registration.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Aevo Support",
